          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Finding: the event-level conclusion remains undetermined\n\nThe relevant work order is **MO-25-09-1070**, internal ID **WO-2025-09-004**, for the **Cooler Plate Pack** at Modine’s Racine operation.\n\n| Requested detail | Verified result |\n|---|---|\n| September cost period | **Sep-25 — PER-COST-2025-09** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** |\n| Source transaction ID | Unavailable from the supplied records |\n| Event amount | Unavailable |\n| Exact event-created time | Unavailable |\n| Minutes after Pending Close | Cannot calculate without the event-created time |\n| Recorded accounting status | Unavailable |\n| Status consistent with Oracle policy? | Cannot determine without the event’s type, timing, and status |\n\nThe Pending Close timestamp is reproduced exactly as stored; the source specifies **no time-zone offset**.\n\n### Oracle’s documented treatment\n\nOracle states that new transactions created after Pending Close, relating to that period or an earlier period, **will not be staged in Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting until the period is closed or reopened**. Transactions entered before Pending Close continue processing, including those in error. **Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions** that continue processing after Pending Close.\n\n*Source: Oracle Supply Chain Cost Management 26B, “Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting,” PDF page 233, printed page 225.*\n\n### Evidence limitation\n\nThe available input contains work orders and cost periods but **no cost-event rows**. The supporting-records service repeatedly returned **“Supporting input was not staged for this assignment.”** Consequently, I cannot establish whether a late event occurred or assess its recorded accounting status. This is **not a finding that no late event occurred**.\n\nThe incomplete audit and provenance were saved to `/cache/work/worker_0a2cff2b978f/audit-report.json` and submitted with a **needs-evidence** result. **No database records were changed.**",
